# Phase 5 L-U1: an automatic compaction that fails inside a turn. Two turns
# (the first reads a file, so a compaction needs notes), then a third whose
# request the provider refuses as too large for the window
# (`provider_overflow`); the notes request is refused, so the compaction
# fails inside the third turn. fx v0.0.16 finishes that turn `.failed`
# (`orchestrator.zig:7864-7865`, `:5615-5618@481104fd`): working, then error.
gateway p5-lifecycle-osc-autocompactfail-turns.json
work compact-ws
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 4
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
wire o00-answered
type third question
key Enter
wait 5
wire o01-failed
gwlog
